      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm coaching my student for a high school debate tournament next week. The topic is Universal Basic Income. My student is on the pro side, but they're struggling to prepare for the counter-arguments. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and provide the most devastating rebuttals possible so they can shut down the opposition?",
